(:sections nil :text
	   ("78017PHH7 / US78017PHH73 Preliminary pricing supplement:"
	    "You should not purchase the PLUS unless you understand and can bear the risks of investing in the PLUS."
	    "sales in the secondary market may result in significant losses."
	    "§ The PLUS are subject to risks relating to non-U.S."
	    "federal income tax consequences of an investment in the PLUS, and you should consult your tax adviser."))
